// CreaturesOpponentControls = "creatures your opponents control" — the
// plural-collective oracle wording, the symmetric-anthem counterpart to
// `OtherCreaturesYouControl` (a debuff over the opposing team rather than a
// boost over your own). Matched by exact case-insensitive subject text (no
// singularize/pluralize normalization). A Selection-kind macro: the whole
// `SelectAll(...)` IS the macro body, so a card spells it as
// `Each(CreaturesOpponentControls, Modify(It, <change>))` directly. Nests the
// reusable `CreatureOpponentControls` Predicate atom rather than repeating
// its `And([...])` filter inline.
(
    name: "CreaturesOpponentControls",
    template: "creatures your opponents control",
    kinds: [Selection],
    body: SelectAll(CreatureOpponentControls),
)
